  <name>eMule Qt</name>
  <summary>File sharing client for the ed2k and Kad networks</summary>
  <developer id="org.emule_qt">
    <name>eMuleQt team</name>
  </developer>

  <description>
    <p>
      eMule Qt is a free, open-source file sharing client for the ED2K and
      Kademlia networks that also downloads BitTorrent, Usenet and file hoster
      links, all from one client. It is rebuilt from the ground up with Qt 6
      and modern C++ and stays compatible with the existing eMule network.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>ED2K servers and the Kademlia DHT</li>
      <li>Protocol obfuscation (TCP/UDP encryption) enabled by default</li>
      <li>BitTorrent, Usenet and file hoster downloads</li>
      <li>Separate core daemon with web UI and REST API</li>
    </ul>
  </description>

  <launchable type="desktop-id">emuleqt.desktop</launchable>
